123:     /// counts through its test's class.
124:     /// </summary>
125:     /// <param name="project">The project whose TRX is checked.</param>
126:     /// <param name="classes">The classes the project's groups named.</param>
127:     /// <param name="xml">The complete TRX content.</param>
128:     /// <returns>Null when every class ran a case; otherwise the failure, naming each class that ran none.</returns>
129:     /// <remarks>
